    {
      "section": "19.23",
      "section_title": "网络 APM 底层捕获原理",
      "priority": 85,
      "reason": "[Deep Tech Review] 19.23 网络 APM 底层捕获原理 存在技术审计未闭环问题（P0:0 P1:1）",
      "material_paths": [
        "logs/deep-review/2026-05-05-14-deep-review.md"
      ],
      "review_issues": [
        {
          "level": "P1",
          "type": "原理断裂",
          "dimension": "原理链完整性",
          "location": "L119-L237、L371-L420（EventListener attempt 建模与弱网重试归因）",
          "detail": "示例用单个 Attempt 保存 requestHeaders/responseHeaders/body 字段；OkHttp EventListener 源码注释明确“Events and sequences of events may be repeated for retries and follow-ups”，requestHeadersStart/responseHeadersStart 可因 redirect/follow-up 在同一 Call 内多次触发。当前代码会覆盖前一次 request/response 阶段，无法区分 redirect、auth follow-up、缓存条件请求与连接重试。",
          "suggestion": "在 request 与 attempt 之间增加 exchange/follow_up 记录，至少把 requestHeaders/responseHeaders/requestBody/responseBody 做成列表；同时记录 responseHeadersEnd、requestFailed/responseFailed、connectionAcquired/released，避免弱网归因只覆盖建连失败。"
        }
      ],
      "added_by": "task9-deep-tech-review",
      "added_at": "2026-05-05T14:20:00+08:00",
      "status": "completed",
      "last_reviewed_by": "task9-deep-tech-review",
      "last_reviewed_at": "2026-05-05T14:20:00+08:00",
      "completed_at": "2026-05-09T18:46:15.335282",
      "completed_reason": "task2b fixed: restructured Attempt→Exchange model for OkHttp EventListener redirect/follow-up support; added responseHeadersEnd/connectionAcquired/Released/requestFailed/responseFailed; fixed Interceptor DNS/TCP explanation"
    },
