      "section": "13.9",
      "section_title": "Android Tracing 基础设施：atrace、ftrace 与 Perfetto 数据采集原理",
      "priority": 85,
      "reason": "[Deep Tech Review] 正文把 android.os.Trace.beginSection() 的 native 路径写成 libcutils/Trace.cpp",
