          "type": "版本差异",
          "severity": "P1",
          "location": "L219（Booster 资源索引内联）",
          "detail": "正文把 R.id/R.layout 统一描述成 static final int，并据此解释字段访问替换。但 AGP 8.0 起 android.nonFinalResIds 与 nonTransitiveRClass 默认开启，应用模块 R 字段不再能按传统 final 常量前提理解。",
          "suggestion": "把该优化限定在旧 AGP/final R id 模式下，补充 AGP 8+ 默认 non-final/non-transitive R 的边界和 Booster/fork 适配状态。",
          "evidence": [
            "AGP 8.0 release notes"
          ]
        }
