    {
      "section": "19.23",
      "section_title": "网络 APM 底层捕获原理",
      "priority": 85,
      "reason": "[Deep Tech Review] 网络 APM EventListener attempt 建模和 TTFB 起点仍会误导弱网归因",
      "material_paths": [
        "intake/suggestions.md"
      ],
      "review_issues": [
        {
          "type": "原理断裂",
          "location": "src/part3-tools/ch19-apm/23-network-apm-internals.md L170-L179/L197-L203",
          "detail": "EventListener 示例在 connectFailed 后立刻 attempts += Attempt()。如果这是最后一次连接失败，随后 callFailed 会把失败写入一个空 attempt，导致 attempt_count 多算，retry_overhead_ms/server_wait_ms 归因被污染。",
          "suggestion": "改成在下一次 connectStart/dnsStart 到来时再懒创建新 attempt，或在 record 前过滤没有任何阶段时间的空 attempt；connectFailed 只结束当前 attempt，不预判一定会重试。"
        },
        {
          "type": "原理断裂",
          "location": "src/part3-tools/ch19-apm/23-network-apm-internals.md L181-L190/L341-L352",
          "detail": "阶段模型没有记录 requestHeadersEnd，却把无请求体场景的 TTFB 起点写成 requestHeadersStart。OkHttp 有 requestHeadersEnd 回调；从 headersStart 计算会把客户端写 header 的时间算进 server wait。",
          "suggestion": "补 requestHeadersEnd/requestBodyStart/requestBodyEnd 字段；无请求体时用 requestHeadersEnd → responseHeadersStart，有请求体时用 requestBodyEnd → responseHeadersStart，并在表格里区分 request send 与 server wait。"
        }
      ],
      "added_by": "task9-deep-tech-review",
      "added_at": "2026-04-27T10:57:00+08:00",
      "status": "completed",
      "completed_at": "2026-05-01T10:46:10.516173",
      "completed_reason": "connectFailed懒创建attempt已修复(避免空attempt归因污染)；requestHeadersEnd回调已补充；TTFB起点已修正为requestHeadersEnd(无body)/requestBodyEnd(有body)；阶段表已拆分Headers/Body"
    },
