          "suggestion": "改成记录校准对：nativeElapsedRealtimeAtInjection、nativeWallClockAtInjection（可选）、jsPerformanceNowAtInjection。H5 entry.startTime 回传后用 nativeElapsedAtInjection + (entry.startTime - jsNowAtInjection) 归一到端侧单调时钟；若使用 timeOrigin 做服务端合并，还要保留 wall-clock offset 与 clock-skew 边界。",
          "evidence": [
            "MDN Performance.timeOrigin: high resolution timestamp baseline for performance-related timestamps",
            "Android SystemClock.elapsedRealtime monotonic clock semantics"
