          "detail": "`WHERE s.name LIKE 'binder%' GROUP BY process.name` 会混合 client 侧 binder transaction、server 侧 binder reply / async receive 等 slice，不能等价于“按 Client 进程统计事务频率”，会把服务端处理和回复也计入调用发起方统计。",
          "suggestion": "Android 16+ 优先用 `INCLUDE PERFETTO MODULE android.binder; SELECT client_process, count(*) FROM android_binder_txns GROUP BY client_process`；低版本则明确只过滤 client-side `binder transaction`，不要把 reply/receive slice 混进 Client 频率统计。"
        }
