        {
          "type": "代码错误/原理断裂",
          "severity": "P0",
          "location": "L151-L156 connectStart 懒创建 attempt",
          "detail": "代码注释说“当前 attempt 已有 failure 就创建新 attempt”，但条件写成 failure != null && connectStartNs == null。一次 connectFailed 后当前 attempt 通常已有 connectStartNs，下一次 connectStart 不会新建 attempt，反而覆盖同一 attempt 的 connectStartNs，导致弱网重试被合并，attempt_count、retry_overhead_ms、失败原因都会失真。dnsStart 也没有处理前一 attempt 已 failure 的场景。",
          "suggestion": "在进入新 DNS/connect 阶段前判断当前 attempt 是否已结束或已有 failure；条件应类似 if (currentAttempt().failure != null || currentAttempt().connectEndNs != null) attempts += Attempt()，并在 dnsStart/connectStart 都统一调用 ensureActiveAttemptForNewRoute()。"
        }
      ],
      "added_by": "task9-deep-tech-review",
      "added_at": "2026-05-01T12:25:00+08:00",
      "status": "completed",
      "completed_at": "2026-05-04T03:48:01.503396",
      "completed_reason": "P0 connectStart attempt懒创建条件已修正：提取ensureActiveAttemptForNewRoute()统一dnsStart/connectStart调用，条件改为failure!=null||connectEndNs!=null"
    },
