          "suggestion": "补上源码 gating：`ShouldUseGenerationalGC()`、`YoungMarkCompact`、`use_generational_cmc`、`persist.device_config.runtime_native_boot.use_generational_gc`；把 “Android 17 统一启用/通常 <1ms” 改成按设备/flag/trace 验证的表述，并把暂停数字改为需要本机 GC histogram 或 Perfetto GC slice 支撑。"
