      "status": "completed",
      "completed_at": "2026-05-08T19:44:22",
      "completed_reason": "P1 WAL checkpoint后台线程错误已修正(auto-checkpoint在提交路径触发)；P1 Room withTransaction'专用线程'已修正为transaction executor调度；P2 批量插入10x-100x已条件化"
