    {
      "section": "1.4",
      "section_title": "Binder IPC 机制与性能影响",
      "priority": 85,
      "reason": "[Deep Tech Review] 1.4 Binder IPC 机制与性能影响 — oneway spam detection 与 async buffer 反压语义仍需回炉修正",
      "material_paths": [
        "intake/suggestions.md",
        "logs/deep-review/2026-05-08-19-deep-review.md",
        "logs/deep-review/2026-05-09-08-deep-review.md"
      ],
      "review_issues": [
        {
          "type": "版本差异/原理断裂",
          "location": "L226 oneway 调用“BR_ONEWAY_SPAM_SUSPECT 限流 / 短暂阻塞”表述",
          "detail": "[P1] Task2B 已删除“Android 14+ Lazy Async”字样，但当前 L226 仍写高频 oneway 会触发 `BR_ONEWAY_SPAM_SUSPECT`“限流”，并把 async buffer 耗尽后的结果收束为“Client 端调用 oneway 方法也可能被短暂阻塞”。复核 android-mainline `drivers/android/binder_alloc.c` 与 `drivers/android/binder.c`：oneway spam detection 在 async 空间低于阈值且同一 pid 占用过多 buffer 时只标记 `oneway_spam_suspect`、返回 `BR_ONEWAY_SPAM_SUSPECT` / netlink report；它是诊断/告警信号，不是限流机制。async buffer 空间不足时 `binder_alloc_new_buf()` 返回 `-ENOSPC`，事务路径返回 `BR_FAILED_REPLY`，不是稳定的“反压导致调用方短暂阻塞”。",
          "suggestion": "把该段改成源码可复核的边界：① 正常 remote `oneway` 在事务进入 Binder 后不等待服务端处理；② 同一 Binder node 上 async transaction 串行，队列积压会影响接收端处理时延；③ async buffer 耗尽时事务失败（Java/Native 层表现为 FAILED_TRANSACTION / BR_FAILED_REPLY 一类错误）；④ `BR_ONEWAY_SPAM_SUSPECT` 是 spam detection 告警，不写成限流；⑤ 若要提“阻塞”，只限定为 ioctl/锁/调度等通用内核路径，不能写成 oneway 专属反压语义。"
        }
      ],
      "added_by": "task9-deep-tech-review",
      "added_at": "2026-05-08T19:29:15+08:00",
      "status": "completed",
      "completed_at": "2026-05-09T08:43:58+08:00",
      "completed_reason": "P1 oneway spam detection/async buffer语义已修正：BR_ONEWAY_SPAM_SUSPECT改为诊断信号非限流机制；async buffer耗尽改为事务失败(BR_FAILED_REPLY)非短暂阻塞；恢复freezer独立边界"
    },
